{"id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-provable-formula.md","title":"Provable Formula","display":"df-provable-formula — Provable Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-provable-formula","aliases":["89-df-provable-formula"],"display":"df-provable-formula — Provable Formula","depends_on":["[[89-df-provability-predicate]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-provable-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-provable-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable-formula — Provable Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 及其固定证明编码取可证明性谓词原子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 为闭算术公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> 是数值证明关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\)</span> 为下述定义的元层句子集合。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\mid\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\mid\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 2 章，印刷页 44–45；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n此为元层可证句子集；等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi\\)</span>。写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span> 而不给数词和满足关系，会混淆对象公式与数值关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\mid\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)","display":false}],"bytes":1199,"backlinks":[{"id":"c1c8665663a75504","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"646431d492b9ae8a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cbb11883655db5cd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7ed22bf7259dd6b3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4cc05e68647fcda4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9aca87310232fb2f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6cbce44a943995a0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)$ is the set of $T$-provable sentences from\n[[89-df-provable-formula]]."},{"id":"f367207d33b1e75f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"19a5fceb5d504d9f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cae39eab3d6562b6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}$ (see [[89-df-provable-formula]])."},{"id":"f04ebe4ce16b21f5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-345","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-provable-formula]]"}],"outgoing":["841985de31202f85"]}